            <title>[KYLIN-5455] After the multi-level partition model is modified to a full build model, the build job fails</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5455</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is inconsistent behavior when multi-level partition model is modified to a full build model.&lt;/p&gt;

